export const labels={PENDING:'待接单',ACCEPTED:'已接单',PRODUCING:'生产中',PAUSED:'已暂停',COMPLETED:'已完成',CANCELLED:'已取消',AVAILABLE:'可用',MAINTENANCE:'维护中',OFFLINE:'停机',OPEN:'待处理',RESOLVED:'已处理',NORMAL:'普通',HIGH:'高',URGENT:'紧急',LOW:'低',MEDIUM:'中',QUALITY:'质量',EQUIPMENT:'设备',MATERIAL:'物料',PROCESS:'工艺'};
export const statusKeys=['PENDING','ACCEPTED','PRODUCING','PAUSED','COMPLETED','CANCELLED'];
export const label=value=>labels[value]||value||'—';
export function beijingDate(value=new Date()){return new Intl.DateTimeFormat('en-CA',{timeZone:'Asia/Shanghai',year:'numeric',month:'2-digit',day:'2-digit'}).format(value)}
export function parseTime(value){if(!value)return NaN;return Date.parse(String(value).replace(' ','T')+( /(?:Z|[+-]\d{2}:?\d{2})$/.test(value)?'':'+08:00'))}
export function formatTime(value){if(!value)return '—';const n=parseTime(value);if(!Number.isFinite(n))return '—';return new Intl.DateTimeFormat('zh-CN',{timeZone:'Asia/Shanghai',month:'2-digit',day:'2-digit',hour:'2-digit',minute:'2-digit',hour12:false}).format(n)}
export function progress(order){return order.quantity>0?Math.min(100,Math.round((order.completedQuantity||0)/order.quantity*100)):0}
export function overdue(order,today=beijingDate()){return !!order.dueDate && order.dueDate<today && !['COMPLETED','CANCELLED'].includes(order.status)}
export function hours(plan,start=-Infinity,end=Infinity){const a=Math.max(parseTime(plan.plannedstart),start),b=Math.min(parseTime(plan.plannedend),end);return Number.isFinite(b-a)?Math.max(0,(b-a)/3600000):0}
const messages={'Use 3–64 lowercase letters, digits, underscore or hyphen':'用户名需为3–64位小写字母、数字、下划线或短横线。','Password must contain 10–72 UTF-8 bytes':'密码长度需为10–72字节，请使用较长的字母和数字组合。','Only accepted orders can be scheduled':'只有已接单的订单才能安排或调整排程。','Report quantities must be positive in total and at most 1000000':'本次合格与不良数量合计须大于0，且不超过100万。','Device must belong to the order factory':'请选择该订单所属工厂的设备。','Schedule must have positive duration and span at most 30 days':'结束时间须晚于开始时间，单次排程不超过30天。','Device, start and end are required':'请填写设备、计划开始和结束时间。','Public registration cannot grant administrator privileges':'公开注册仅支持工厂管理员与经销商。','Daily capacity must be 30..1440 minutes':'参考日产能须在30至1440分钟之间。','Device schedule overlaps another active order':'该设备在此时段已有其他订单，请调整设备或时间。','Order changed; refresh before retrying':'订单已被其他操作更新，已刷新数据，请核对后重新提交。','Device changed; refresh before retrying':'设备资料已更新，请核对后重新提交。','Issue changed; refresh before retrying':'异常状态已更新，请核对后重新提交。','Schedule the order before starting production':'请先为订单安排设备和生产时间。','Device is unavailable':'设备处于维护或停机状态，请先恢复设备。','Device already has a running order':'该设备已有生产中的订单。请先暂停或完成该订单。','Good output must meet the ordered quantity before completion':'合格产量尚未达到订单数量，暂不能完成。','Good output exceeds the ordered quantity':'本次合格产量超过剩余订单数量，请核对。','Resolve high-severity issues before completion':'请先处理该订单的高严重度异常。','Resolve high-severity issues before starting production':'请先处理该订单的高严重度异常，再开始或恢复生产。','Pause running production before taking this device out of service':'请先暂停该设备正在执行的订单，再设置维护或停机。','Only running orders accept production reports':'仅生产中的订单可报工。','Login required':'登录已失效，请重新登录。','Invalid credentials':'用户名或密码不正确。','Operation not permitted':'当前账号没有此操作权限。','Duplicate value, referenced resource, or invalid data constraint':'名称已被使用，或该记录仍被其他业务引用，请检查后重试。','Due date cannot be in the past':'交期不能早于今天。'};
export function errorMessage(e){const raw=e.response?.data?.error;return messages[raw]||(e.response?.status===401?'登录已失效，请重新登录。':e.response?.status===403?'当前账号没有此操作权限。':e.response?.status===409?'数据发生冲突，请刷新后核对。':e.response?.status===400?(raw||'填写内容有误，请检查必填项与数量。'):'暂时无法完成操作，请检查服务连接后重试。')}
export function csvText(rows){const cell=v=>{let s=String(v??'');if(/^[=+@\-\t\r]/.test(s))s="'"+s;return '"'+s.replace(/"/g,'""')+'"'};return '\uFEFF'+rows.map(r=>r.map(cell).join(',')).join('\r\n')}
export function downloadCsv(rows,name){const url=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([csvText(rows)],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'}));const a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download=name;a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000)}

export function beijingWeekStart(now = new Date()) {
  const date = beijingDate(now);
  const midnight = Date.parse(date + "T00:00:00Z");
  const weekday = new Date(midnight).getUTCDay();
  return new Date(midnight - ((weekday + 6) % 7) * 86400000).toISOString().slice(0, 10);
}
